From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 14:04:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(connection): remove the server blacklist

ViaBedrock refused to log in to a fixed list of hosts (The Hive and
DonutSMP) unless disable-server-blacklist was set, because their anti-cheats
are known to ban translated clients. StackAnvil users decide which servers
they join, so this local patch removes the list, the login check and the
config option. Joining such a server still carries the ban risk the list
warned about.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/ViaBedrockConfig.java b/src/main/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/ViaBedrockConfig.java
index 7a13964934c5014702b0b2ab2330ede160734d47..d303bdb4fdb67e37df2ee04efc4b2811e5514b46 100644
